    "侧台烘干并存档 · 回到桥口再接桥": "Dry and save on the side ledge, then return to the bridge mouth",
    "檐下长按 Shift / B 接桥 · 多人由同伴踩住对岸圆板": "Hold Shift / B beneath the roof; teammates latch the far-bank plate"
